1
00:00:00,937 --> 00:00:03,537
(Howard:)We are going
to Meh-he-co!

2
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:04,711
Fun, I've never been there!

3
00:00:04,709 --> 00:00:06,539
Leonard, don't be fooled!

4
00:00:06,544 --> 00:00:07,844
(Sheldon:)I'm from Texas...

5
00:00:07,845 --> 00:00:11,315
Meh-he-co is Spanish for Mexico.

6
00:00:11,315 --> 00:00:13,215
(Raj:)What's wrong with Mexico?

7
00:00:13,217 --> 00:00:15,887
(Sheldon:)Uh, mariachi bands, wild dogs,

8
00:00:15,887 --> 00:00:19,217
(Sheldon:)beans that jump around
'cause there's a worm inside.

9
00:00:19,223 --> 00:00:20,853
(Howard:)Okay, calm down.

10
00:00:20,858 --> 00:00:22,128
(Howard:)There's a theme
to this weekend.

11
00:00:22,126 --> 00:00:25,696
(Howard:)We are going to Mexico
in Feynman's van

12
00:00:25,697 --> 00:00:28,167
(Howard:)to stay at the vacation house
Feynman bought

13
00:00:28,166 --> 00:00:30,036
(Howard:)with the money
from his Nobel Prize.

14
00:00:30,034 --> 00:00:31,664
Viva la Imodium!

15
00:00:31,669 --> 00:00:33,199
Ay-ay-ay!

16
00:00:36,273 --> 00:00:38,713
(Bernadette:)Come on, Leonard's
doing bachelor stuff.

17
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:40,440
(Bernadette:)You sure we can't take
you to a strip club?

18
00:00:40,445 --> 00:00:43,145
(Penny:)Nah, if I want to see
a naked dancing man,

19
00:00:43,147 --> 00:00:45,077
(Penny:)I just flush the toilet
while Leonard's in the shower.

20
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:46,413
(giggles)

21
00:00:48,218 --> 00:00:50,658
(Sheldon:)Hi.
Hey.

22
00:00:50,655 --> 00:00:52,755
(Amy:)I know we're not making a fuss,

23
00:00:52,757 --> 00:00:55,687
(Amy:)but in the spirit
of bachelorette parties,

24
00:00:55,693 --> 00:01:00,023
(Amy:)I made cookies in the
shape of male genitals.

